### 遴选评分 + 公示接口示例（VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client 均可）
### 运行环境：Python > 3.10.9、Django 5.2 LTS、django-ninja >=1.6,<2.0（与主程序一致）
### 启动前：
###   python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
###   python manage.py migrate
###   python manage.py seed_demo
###   python manage.py runserver 8001
###
### 自动文档（独立运行）：
###   Swagger UI  http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/selection/docs
###   OpenAPI     http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/selection/openapi.json
### 完整参数/字段/错误码说明见同目录 成员6-遴选评分与报名公示接口文档.md / API.md
###
### 演示档案（字符串 ID）：高校组 "10001"-"10015"，中学组 "20001"-"20015"，
### 小学组 "30001"-"30015"；所有演示数据属于 event_id="1"。
### 演示数据下所有球员都已有初选/复选评分，直接执行“录入评分”会返回 409。
### 想手动测试录入：先执行
###   python manage.py seed_demo --reset --templates-only
### 再执行下面的“新建模板”，把返回的 id 填到“录入评分”的 template_id。
###
### 独立运行：写操作通过 X-User-Id 记录审计用户，管理接口不鉴权。
### 并入主程序后：基础地址改为 http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1，
###   管理接口必须携带 Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>；
###   门户公示 GET（列表/详情/市州）仍然公开；event_id 用 evt_...，档案 ID 用 rst_...。
###   此时把下面的 X-User-Id 换成 Authorization 头即可。

@host = http://127.0.0.1:8001
@eventId = 1
@userId = 1
@token = 在这里粘贴主程序登录返回的 accessToken

### 1. 模板列表：高校组初选
GET {{host}}/api/selection/templates/?group_type=HIGHER&round=INITIAL

### 2. 新建模板（权重之和必须为 100）
POST {{host}}/api/selection/templates/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "name": "高校组初选评分模板",
  "group_type": "HIGHER",
  "round": "INITIAL",
  "items": [
    {"dimension_code": "TECH", "dimension_name": "技术能力", "weight": 30, "max_score": 100},
    {"dimension_code": "MATCH", "dimension_name": "比赛表现", "weight": 30, "max_score": 100},
    {"dimension_code": "PHYSICAL", "dimension_name": "身体素质", "weight": 20, "max_score": 100},
    {"dimension_code": "TACTIC", "dimension_name": "战术意识", "weight": 20, "max_score": 100}
  ]
}

### 3. 模板详情（把 1 换成实际 id）
GET {{host}}/api/selection/templates/1/

### 4. 修改模板名称/维度（不能修改 group_type 和 round）
PUT {{host}}/api/selection/templates/1/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "name": "高校组初选评分模板（修订）",
  "items": [
    {"dimension_code": "TECH", "dimension_name": "技术能力", "weight": 40, "max_score": 100},
    {"dimension_code": "MATCH", "dimension_name": "比赛表现", "weight": 30, "max_score": 100},
    {"dimension_code": "PHYSICAL", "dimension_name": "身体素质", "weight": 15, "max_score": 100},
    {"dimension_code": "TACTIC", "dimension_name": "战术意识", "weight": 15, "max_score": 100}
  ]
}

### 5. 录入初选评分
POST {{host}}/api/selection/scores/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "event_id": "1",
  "group_type": "HIGHER",
  "round": "INITIAL",
  "template_id": 1,
  "candidate_id": "10001",
  "scores": [
    {"dimension_code": "TECH", "score": 92},
    {"dimension_code": "MATCH", "score": 88},
    {"dimension_code": "PHYSICAL", "score": 85},
    {"dimension_code": "TACTIC", "score": 90}
  ]
}

### 6. 录入复选评分（把 template_id 换成复选模板 id）
POST {{host}}/api/selection/scores/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "event_id": "1",
  "group_type": "HIGHER",
  "round": "FINAL",
  "template_id": 2,
  "candidate_id": "10001",
  "scores": [
    {"dimension_code": "TECH", "score": 95},
    {"dimension_code": "MATCH", "score": 90},
    {"dimension_code": "PHYSICAL", "score": 86},
    {"dimension_code": "TACTIC", "score": 92}
  ]
}

### 7. 评分详情（含每个维度得分）
GET {{host}}/api/selection/scores/1/

### 8. 修改评分（只改维度得分）
PUT {{host}}/api/selection/scores/1/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "scores": [
    {"dimension_code": "TECH", "score": 95},
    {"dimension_code": "MATCH", "score": 90},
    {"dimension_code": "PHYSICAL", "score": 85},
    {"dimension_code": "TACTIC", "score": 90}
  ]
}

### 9. 分页查询评分
GET {{host}}/api/selection/scores/?event_id=1&group_type=HIGHER&round=INITIAL&page=1&size=10

### 10. 关键字搜索（姓名/球队）
GET {{host}}/api/selection/scores/?event_id=1&group_type=HIGHER&round=INITIAL&keyword=张

### 11. 初选汇总排名
GET {{host}}/api/selection/scores/summary/?event_id=1&group_type=HIGHER&round=INITIAL

### 12. 复选汇总排名
GET {{host}}/api/selection/scores/summary/?event_id=1&group_type=HIGHER&round=FINAL

### 13. 导出评分 Excel（用浏览器打开，或 curl -OJ）
GET {{host}}/api/selection/scores/export/?event_id=1&group_type=HIGHER&round=INITIAL
Accept: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

### 14. 生成高校组复选结果（新版本）
POST {{host}}/api/selection/results/generate/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "event_id": "1",
  "group_type": "HIGHER",
  "result_round": "FINAL",
  "quota": 11,
  "initial_weight": 0.4,
  "final_weight": 0.6
}

### 15. 生成初选结果（只使用初选成绩）
POST {{host}}/api/selection/results/generate/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "event_id": "1",
  "group_type": "HIGHER",
  "result_round": "INITIAL",
  "quota": 11
}

### 16. 当前有效结果
GET {{host}}/api/selection/results/latest/?event_id=1&group_type=HIGHER

### 17. 结果历史批次
GET {{host}}/api/selection/results/batches/?event_id=1&group_type=HIGHER&limit=20

### 18. 导出遴选结果 Excel
GET {{host}}/api/selection/results/export/?event_id=1&group_type=HIGHER
Accept: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

### 19. 三组结果都生成一次
POST {{host}}/api/selection/results/generate/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"event_id": "1", "group_type": "HIGHER", "quota": 11}

###
POST {{host}}/api/selection/results/generate/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"event_id": "1", "group_type": "MIDDLE", "quota": 11}

###
POST {{host}}/api/selection/results/generate/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"event_id": "1", "group_type": "PRIMARY", "quota": 11}

### ==================================================================
### T6-04 公示（D6）
### 演示数据默认已公示：每组 10001-10003、C1001、T1001。
### 想体验“首次公示”，可用 10004、C1002、T1002 等未被 seed 的记录。
### ==================================================================

### 20. 公示一条运动员报名信息
POST {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "event_id": "1",
  "publicity_type": "ATHLETE",
  "source_id": "10004"
}

### 21. 公示一条教练员报名信息
POST {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "event_id": "1",
  "publicity_type": "COACH",
  "source_id": "C1002"
}

### 22. 公示一支球队报名信息
POST {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "event_id": "1",
  "publicity_type": "TEAM",
  "source_id": "T1002"
}

### 23. 门户公示列表（只返回已公示）
GET {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/?event_id=1&page=1&size=10

### 24. 按组别 + 市州查询
GET {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/?event_id=1&group_type=HIGHER&city=江城市&page=1&size=10

### 25. 按公示类型查询（ATHLETE/COACH/TEAM 或 运动员/教练员/球队）
GET {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/?event_id=1&publicity_type=ATHLETE

### 26. 市州选项（用于前端筛选下拉框）
GET {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/cities/?event_id=1&group_type=HIGHER

### 27. 门户公示详情（把 1 换成实际 id；取消后返回 404）
GET {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/1/

### 28. 取消公示（把 1 换成实际 id）
POST {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/1/cancel/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "reason": "报名信息有误，退回修改"
}

### 29. CMS 公示管理列表（含已取消记录）
GET {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/manage/?event_id=1&page=1&size=20

### 30. 只看已取消记录
GET {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/manage/?event_id=1&status=CANCELLED

### 31. CMS 公示详情（含取消原因、操作人）
GET {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/manage/1/

### 32. 批量公示中学组全部教练员（已公示的自动跳过）
POST {{host}}/api/selection/publicity/batch/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "event_id": "1",
  "group_type": "MIDDLE",
  "publicity_type": "COACH"
}
